<div class="pd-voice-listener-documentation">
    <section id="overview">
        <h2 class="doc-section">Overview</h2>
        <p>
            <code>PDVoiceListener</code> captures browser speech recognition input and publishes timestamped stream items via <code>IListenerService</code>.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="modes">
        <h2 class="doc-section">Modes</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><code>ManualActivation</code> emits text only between start/stop actions.</li>
            <li><code>KeywordActivation</code> requires an exact keyword and falls back to <code>ActiveAwaitingKeyword</code> after silence.</li>
            <li><code>Continuous</code> emits all recognized phrases continuously.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</div>
